     "type": "established",
     "claim_text": "Fresno, California, May 2013: police say two 20-year-old men dialled 911 by accident from a cell phone while on their way to break into a car; the dispatcher heard the whole thing. Narration: 'Police say burglars butt-dialed 911.' Headline 'BURGLARS BUTT-DIALED / 911 MID-BREAK-IN'. Charged only: never named, silhouettes.",
     "urls": [
      "https://abcnews.go.com/blogs/headlines/2013/05/suspects-butt-dial-9-1-1-during-alleged-burglary",
      "https://archive.findlaw.com/?p=34087",
